  <NAME>A Global CRISPR/Cas9 Screen Identifies Mitochondrial Translation as an Essential Process for Latent KSHV Infection in Human Endothelial Cells</NAME>
  <TITLE>A Global CRISPR/Cas9 Screen Identifies Mitochondrial Translation as an Essential Process for Latent KSHV Infection in Human Endothelial Cells</TITLE>
  <DESCRIPTION>We report on a CRISPR/Cas9 screen in human endothelial cells comparing uninfected to KSHV infected cells. Overall design: Comparison of sgRNA abundance between uninfected and KSHV infected cells in both the living cells and dead cells over an 8 day selection period.</DESCRIPTION>
